Description: HiFiBerry Bluetooth Audio Management with Web API
 Tools and configuration for managing Bluetooth audio on HiFiBerry systems.
 This package provides utilities for configuring and managing Bluetooth
 audio connections, pairing, and audio routing. The system automatically
 becomes discoverable as a Bluetooth audio sink for devices like iPhones.
 Uses PipeWire for audio processing.
 .
 Includes a web-based REST API and HTML interface for remote management
 of Bluetooth pairing, PIN codes, discoverable mode, and paired devices.
 The web interface is available on port 1082.
